1
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:17,160
Holy Spirit, in the morning,

2
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:20,900
When the fields are washed in gold,

3
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:24,380
I grow quiet in Your presence,

4
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:27,040
Let Your will take full control.

5
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:30,600
You are nearer than my breathing,

6
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:34,580
Yet Your throne is over all;

7
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:38,080
With a heart that loves Your leading,

8
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:42,560
I will answer when You call.

9
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:46,400
Holy Spirit, You are King,

10
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:49,200
Every breath is Yours to lead.

11
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:53,220
You're the Father. You're the Son.

12
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:55,000
You are King.

13
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,300
You are one, and all I need.

14
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:00,140
Yours the power,

15
00:01:00,140 --> 00:01:01,880
Yours the Kingdom,

16
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:05,380
Yours the right to rule in me.

17
00:01:05,380 --> 00:01:08,800
Let my love become obedience,

18
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:12,550
Let my life be Your decree.

19
00:01:16,740 --> 00:01:18,580
When Your whisper

20
00:01:18,580 --> 00:01:20,520
meets my wanting,

21
00:01:20,520 --> 00:01:24,000
Teach my heart to choose Your way.

22
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:27,580
Let my yes be more than singing,

23
00:01:27,580 --> 00:01:30,880
Let it live through every day.

24
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:34,600
Not from fear, but love that listens,

25
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:37,400
I lay down my claim to reign;

26
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:41,020
You command with perfect wisdom,

27
00:01:41,020 --> 00:01:46,080
I delight to bear Your name.

28
00:01:46,080 --> 00:01:49,840
Holy Spirit, You are King,

29
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:53,380
Every breath is Yours to lead.

30
00:01:53,380 --> 00:01:56,620
You're the Father. You're the Son.

31
00:01:56,620 --> 00:01:58,360
You are King.

32
00:01:58,360 --> 00:02:01,260
You are one, and all I need.

33
00:02:01,260 --> 00:02:03,500
Yours the power,

34
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:05,340
Yours the Kingdom,

35
00:02:05,340 --> 00:02:08,720
Yours the right to rule in me.

36
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:12,240
Let my love become obedience,

37
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:17,120
Let my life be Your decree.

38
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:20,800
No power stands above You,

39
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:23,640
No throne can take Your place.

40
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:27,500
Your authority is endless,

41
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:31,200
And Your nearness fills my days.

42
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:34,460
In the quiet, in the working,

43
00:02:34,460 --> 00:02:38,080
Keep my heart close to Your own.

44
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:41,300
Every thought and every longing,

45
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:46,140
Make them subject to Your throne.

46
00:02:46,140 --> 00:02:50,020
Holy Spirit, You are King,

47
00:02:50,020 --> 00:02:53,640
Every breath is Yours to lead.

48
