Yours the Kingdom,

53
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:08,640
Yours the right to rule in me.

54
00:03:08,640 --> 00:03:12,440
Let my love become obedience,

55
00:03:12,440 --> 00:03:17,220
Let my life be Your decree.

56
00:03:17,220 --> 00:03:21,520
Holy Spirit, reign within me,

57
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:25,620
I am Yours in everything.

58
00:03:25,620 --> 00:03:31,560
Let my love become obedience,

59
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:36,660
Holy Spirit, You are King.
